                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Warning.... You need need a large play area, make sure you have the required space. \n\nIt's a simple game, it's an easy game, it's a borning game. And it's not worth £5.99. Fortunately I got this in a VR bundle so it was about 50p. Though quite honestly this should be a free game. Kids will enjoy this for a bit, but there really isn't much going on, they'll get bored too. The premise is using the sling to launch the requested presents to the marked house. No  skill needed, a visual arc shows you're shot.\n\nThis is one of those VR titles you'll try once, and never come back too.",
